// Copy to Config/Local.xcconfig (gitignored) and fill in.
//
// This file is included LAST by Config/Ninety.xcconfig, so anything set here
// overrides the committed defaults. Set the real build settings directly —
// there is no indirection through a NINETY_* variable to get wrong.
//
// DEVELOPMENT_TEAM — your Apple Developer team id, 10 characters.
//                    developer.apple.com/account, under Membership details.
//                    Only a device build needs it; the Simulator does not.
//
// PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER — only if app.ninety.Ninety is already taken on
//                    your account. It must match the App ID you register.
//
// Neither is a secret, but both identify an individual account, and this
// repository is read by other people.

DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
// PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER = com.yourname.ninety
